              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.16.14+MRK.16.15+MRK.16.16+MRK.16.17+MRK.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 16:14-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.24.36+LUK.24.37+LUK.24.38+LUK.24.39+LUK.24.40+LUK.24.41+LUK.24.42+LUK.24.43+LUK.24.44+LUK.24.45+LUK.24.46+LUK.24.47+LUK.24.48+LUK.24.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 24:36-49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ikawa jioni, siku ile ya kwanza ya juma, pale walipokuwapo wanafunzi, milango imefungwa kwa hofu ya Wayahudi; akaja Yesu, akasimama katikati, akawaambia, Amani iwe kwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.1.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Yoh 1:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naye akiisha kusema hayo, akawaonesha mikono yake na ubavu wake. Basi wale wanafunzi wakafurahi walipomwona Bwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.17.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yn 17:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi Yesu akawaambia tena, Amani iwe kwenu; kama Baba alivyonituma mimi, mimi nami nawatuma ninyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
