              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi, baada ya siku nane, wanafunzi wake walikuwamo ndani tena, na Tomaso pamoja nao. Akaja Yesu, na milango imefungwa, akasimama katikati, akasema, Amani iwe kwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
